{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity survived the introduction of magic, barely. Now, the world is divided by nations wielding their own magic specialties, and otherworldly creatures have crossed over, drawn by the surge of magic. <br><br>In <i>Sunyata,</i> master a single magic type or combine elements to discover powerful synergies. Experiment with endless deck building strategies then watch your creatures come to life on the field through interactive abilities that match their flavor.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/9530c4869f5f5513b4eb6c52b977b956.poster.avif?t=1764647439\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/9530c4869f5f5513b4eb6c52b977b956.webm?t=1764647439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/9530c4869f5f5513b4eb6c52b977b956.mp4?t=1764647439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All New Mana System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your castle's mana and abilities each turn by selecting two of four generated support cards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/663461e17a2d7c51f0cc1c6acf28b6bd.poster.avif?t=1764647439\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/663461e17a2d7c51f0cc1c6acf28b6bd.webm?t=1764647439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/663461e17a2d7c51f0cc1c6acf28b6bd.mp4?t=1764647439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creative Deck Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from one to three mana types and build your deck to suit your favorite playstyle.  Each mana type offers its own strengths and abilities; combine multiple types to craft unique strategies and uncover hidden synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash water mana with rush decks that flood the field with swarming crabs or control the battlefield with mechs by fusing electricity and steel mana. Burn through your opponents' defenses with fire mana utilizing dragons and powerful mages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/f83e56e8fa6a38d22982789d5ccd4122.poster.avif?t=1764647439\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/f83e56e8fa6a38d22982789d5ccd4122.webm?t=1764647439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/f83e56e8fa6a38d22982789d5ccd4122.mp4?t=1764647439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fantasy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of <i><strong>Sunyata</strong></i>. Uncover the history of magic\u2019s arrival, the near extinction event it brought, and the tumultuous growth and conflicts humanity experienced adapting it to daily life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card reveals a window into the lore in its flavor text. Delve further and explore the minds of our unique characters through the life philosophies that drive their actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/2c86f0dcb88e6bb5826f505c754d6614.poster.avif?t=1764647439\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/2c86f0dcb88e6bb5826f505c754d6614.webm?t=1764647439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/2c86f0dcb88e6bb5826f505c754d6614.mp4?t=1764647439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Card Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creatures with interactive abilities! Clickable buttons summon token creatures or cast spells; targeted abilities launch fireballs or toss enchanted fruit to boost allies. Equip weapons, enhancements, or even dragon riders to unlock powerful synergies. Guide your creature's evolution: choose to strengthen its stats or transform into a new creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master our all-new mage level system and use magic to control the battlefield. Choose between standard spells with traditional mana costs or unlock potent, efficient spells with high level mages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunyata</strong> is free to download and play, offering full access to all cards through in-game progress. Our rewarding system ensures that both free and paying players can explore countless deck types and strategies. Every player starts with eight free decks, unlockable in single-player mode, and can earn booster packs through game play rewards in both ranked and draft mode, totaling over 400 playable cards!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603960?t=1764647439","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/f7c4f8a1869bc74d1ba613e1854404125afd0bdf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764647439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/8e729b196e91e9b5f7867937b3f3476f4fd9c035/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764647439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/8e729b196e91e9b5f7867937b3f3476f4fd9c035/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764647439","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity survived the introduction of magic, barely. Now, the world is divided by nations wielding their own magic specialties, and otherworldly creatures have crossed over, drawn by the surge of magic. <br><br>In <i>Sunyata,</i> master a single magic type or combine elements to discover powerful synergies. Experiment with endless deck building strategies then watch your creatures come to life on the field through interactive abilities that match their flavor.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/9530c4869f5f5513b4eb6c52b977b956.poster.avif?t=1764647439\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/9530c4869f5f5513b4eb6c52b977b956.webm?t=1764647439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/9530c4869f5f5513b4eb6c52b977b956.mp4?t=1764647439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All New Mana System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your castle's mana and abilities each turn by selecting two of four generated support cards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/663461e17a2d7c51f0cc1c6acf28b6bd.poster.avif?t=1764647439\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/663461e17a2d7c51f0cc1c6acf28b6bd.webm?t=1764647439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/663461e17a2d7c51f0cc1c6acf28b6bd.mp4?t=1764647439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creative Deck Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from one to three mana types and build your deck to suit your favorite playstyle.  Each mana type offers its own strengths and abilities; combine multiple types to craft unique strategies and uncover hidden synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash water mana with rush decks that flood the field with swarming crabs or control the battlefield with mechs by fusing electricity and steel mana. Burn through your opponents' defenses with fire mana utilizing dragons and powerful mages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/f83e56e8fa6a38d22982789d5ccd4122.poster.avif?t=1764647439\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/f83e56e8fa6a38d22982789d5ccd4122.webm?t=1764647439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/f83e56e8fa6a38d22982789d5ccd4122.mp4?t=1764647439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fantasy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of <i><strong>Sunyata</strong></i>. Uncover the history of magic\u2019s arrival, the near extinction event it brought, and the tumultuous growth and conflicts humanity experienced adapting it to daily life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card reveals a window into the lore in its flavor text. Delve further and explore the minds of our unique characters through the life philosophies that drive their actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/2c86f0dcb88e6bb5826f505c754d6614.poster.avif?t=1764647439\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/2c86f0dcb88e6bb5826f505c754d6614.webm?t=1764647439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/2c86f0dcb88e6bb5826f505c754d6614.mp4?t=1764647439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Card Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creatures with interactive abilities! Clickable buttons summon token creatures or cast spells; targeted abilities launch fireballs or toss enchanted fruit to boost allies. Equip weapons, enhancements, or even dragon riders to unlock powerful synergies. Guide your creature's evolution: choose to strengthen its stats or transform into a new creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master our all-new mage level system and use magic to control the battlefield. Choose between standard spells with traditional mana costs or unlock potent, efficient spells with high level mages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunyata</strong> is free to download and play, offering full access to all cards through in-game progress. Our rewarding system ensures that both free and paying players can explore countless deck types and strategies. Every player starts with eight free decks, unlockable in single-player mode, and can earn booster packs through game play rewards in both ranked and draft mode, totaling over 400 playable cards!</p>","developers":["Nagarjuna Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/c9a29d5243607f03d8082c9c2f6fccc5c535530e/header.jpg?t=1764647439","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603960/512468795/a5491391afb76c93470784f63515f1522e4503f4/1763757106/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763758162","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603960/512468795/a5491391afb76c93470784f63515f1522e4503f4/1763757106/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763758162","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603960/512468795/a5491391afb76c93470784f63515f1522e4503f4/1763757106/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763758162","id":257236071,"name":"Playtest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257236071/3417c3dc77033a8a4c49fc5bc2a007d841300bc9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763758162"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603960/660922073/dd90a61c121a79c7ca8e6dd4bb978b7306e5a088/1751665952/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751990772","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603960/660922073/dd90a61c121a79c7ca8e6dd4bb978b7306e5a088/1751665952/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751990772","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603960/660922073/dd90a61c121a79c7ca8e6dd4